{"html_text": {"ja369:0.1": "<article id='ja369'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja369:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja369:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja369:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja369:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja369:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja369:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja369:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja369:2.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja369:2.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja369:2.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja369:2.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja369:3.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja369:3.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja369:3.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja369:3.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja369:4.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja369:4.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja369:4.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja369:4.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja369:4.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja369:4.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja369:5.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja369:5.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja369:5.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja369:5.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja369:6.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja369:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja369:0.2": "Pañcakanipāta ", "ja369:0.3": "Vaṇṇārohavagga ", "ja369:0.4": "9. Mittavindakajātaka ", "ja369:1.1": "“Kyāhaṁ devānamakaraṁ, ", "ja369:1.2": "kiṁ pāpaṁ pakataṁ mayā; ", "ja369:1.3": "Yaṁ me sirasmiṁ ohacca, ", "ja369:1.4": "cakkaṁ bhamati matthake”. ", "ja369:2.1": "“Atikkamma ramaṇakaṁ, ", "ja369:2.2": "sadāmattañca dūbhakaṁ; ", "ja369:2.3": "Brahmattarañca pāsādaṁ, ", "ja369:2.4": "kenatthena idhāgato”. ", "ja369:3.1": "“Ito bahutarā bhogā, ", "ja369:3.2": "atra maññe bhavissare; ", "ja369:3.3": "Iti etāya saññāya, ", "ja369:3.4": "passa maṁ byasanaṁ gataṁ”. ", "ja369:4.1": "“Catubbhi aṭṭhajjhagamā, ", "ja369:4.2": "aṭṭhāhipi ca soḷasa; ", "ja369:4.3": "Soḷasāhi ca bāttiṁsa, ", "ja369:4.4": "atricchaṁ cakkamāsado; ", "ja369:4.5": "Icchāhatassa posassa, ", "ja369:4.6": "cakkaṁ bhamati matthake. ", "ja369:5.1": "Uparivisālā duppūrā, ", "ja369:5.2": "icchā visaṭagāminī; ", "ja369:5.3": "Ye ca taṁ anugijjhanti, ", "ja369:5.4": "te honti cakkadhārino”ti. ", "ja369:6.1": "Mittavindakajātakaṁ navamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja369:0.1": "", "ja369:0.2": "", "ja369:0.3": "", "ja369:0.4": "", "ja369:1.1": "", "ja369:1.2": "", "ja369:1.3": "ohacca → ūhacca (pts-vp-pli1); uhacca (mr) ", "ja369:1.4": "", "ja369:2.1": "", "ja369:2.2": "", "ja369:2.3": "", "ja369:2.4": "", "ja369:3.1": "", "ja369:3.2": "", "ja369:3.3": "", "ja369:3.4": "", "ja369:4.1": "", "ja369:4.2": "aṭṭhāhipi ca → aṭṭhakābhi (bj); aṭṭhābhi cāpi (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja369:4.3": "", "ja369:4.4": "", "ja369:4.5": "", "ja369:4.6": "", "ja369:5.1": "Uparivisālā duppūrā → uparivisālaṁ duppūraṁ (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja369:5.2": "icchā visaṭagāminī → icchā visadagāminī (bj); icchāvisaṭagāminiṁ (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja369:5.3": "", "ja369:5.4": "", "ja369:6.1": "Mittavindakajātakaṁ → mittavindukajātakaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed); mittavindajātakaṁ (pts-vp-pli1) "}, "reference_text": {"ja369:0.1": "", "ja369:0.2": "", "ja369:0.3": "", "ja369:0.4": "", "ja369:1.1": "bj30.226, ms22J_1265, msdiv100, pts-vp-pli3.206", "ja369:1.2": "", "ja369:1.3": "", "ja369:1.4": "", "ja369:2.1": "ms22J_1266, msdiv101, pts-vp-pli3.207", "ja369:2.2": "", "ja369:2.3": "", "ja369:2.4": "", "ja369:3.1": "ms22J_1267, msdiv102", "ja369:3.2": "", "ja369:3.3": "", "ja369:3.4": "", "ja369:4.1": "dr27.180, ms22J_1268, msdiv103", "ja369:4.2": "", "ja369:4.3": "", "ja369:4.4": "", "ja369:4.5": "", "ja369:4.6": "", "ja369:5.1": "ms22J_1269, msdiv104, sya27.181", "ja369:5.2": "", "ja369:5.3": "", "ja369:5.4": "", "ja369:6.1": "ms22J_1270"}, "k